  "id": "sperm-competition",
  "term": "sperm competition",
  "definition": "Sperm competition is competition among sperm from different males to fertilize a female’s eggs when she mates with two or more males during the same receptive period. It is described as a strong evolutionary influence on male reproductive behavior and related biological traits.",
